        "text": "There are many ways to buy cryptocurrencies. The first thing you'll need to do is convert your fiat currency into a cryptocurrency. Then you can choose to either hold it, trade it for other cryptocurrencies, or lend it and earn interest. By the way, you can learn more about it in Binance Academy's crypto trading courses, so don't forget to check that out. For this module, we will take a look at the two main types of cryptocurrency centralized exchanges and decentralized exchanges. You might find the concept of a centralized exchange a bit confusing, since cryptocurrencies are often referred to as decentralized. The idea of centralized crypto exchanges refers to the use of a middleman to help conduct transactions. Buyers and sellers trust this third party to handle their assets, so the way the exchanges work is centralized and requires trust in a third party.",
